	"Reserve the promotion for $120. More orders, very little room on a shared gigabit link.": {"en": "Reserve the promotion for $120. More orders, very little room on a shared gigabit link.", "hu": "Foglald le a promóciót 120 $-ért. Több rendelés, nagyon kevés hely egy megosztott gigabites linken."},
	"Cheap and impatient, but they grow fast if they survive.": {"en": "Cheap and impatient, but they grow fast if they survive.", "hu": "Olcsók és türelmetlenek, de gyorsan nőnek, ha túlélik."},
