	"Add the check that would have told you first. A monitor you add after an outage is the cheapest thing in this game.": {"en": "Add the check that would have told you first. A monitor you add after an outage is the cheapest thing in this game.", "hu": "Add hozzá az ellenőrzést, amely elsőként szólt volna. Egy kiesés után hozzáadott monitor a legolcsóbb dolog ebben a játékban."},
	"Save what is running, and put somebody on the labelling and documentation duty so it stops being your job to remember.": {"en": "Save what is running, and put somebody on the labelling and documentation duty so it stops being your job to remember.", "hu": "Mentsd el, ami fut, és állíts valakit a címkézési és dokumentációs feladatra, hogy ne a te dolgod legyen észben tartani."},
