	"Nothing happened. Everything that was up is still up.": {"en": "Nothing happened. Everything that was up is still up.", "hu": "Semmi sem történt. Ami ment, az még mindig megy."},
	"holding": {"en": "holding", "hu": "tartja magát"},
	"getting better": {"en": "getting better", "hu": "javul"},
	"getting worse": {"en": "getting worse", "hu": "romlik"},
	"Reliability: %d cycle(s) clear, best %d.": {"en": "Reliability: %d cycle(s) clear, best %d.", "hu": "Megbízhatóság: %d ciklus tiszta, a legjobb %d."},
	"The floor: %d%% kept, %s.": {"en": "The floor: %d%% kept, %s.", "hu": "A gépterem: %d%%-ban rendben, %s."},
	"Documentation: %d%% of it no longer matches the floor, %s.": {"en": "Documentation: %d%% of it no longer matches the floor, %s.", "hu": "Dokumentáció: %d%%-a már nem egyezik a gépteremmel, %s."},
	"What the team copies from you: %s most (%d%%), %s least (%d%%).": {"en": "What the team copies from you: %s most (%d%%), %s least (%d%%).", "hu": "Amit a csapat átvesz tőled: %s leginkább (%d%%), %s legkevésbé (%d%%)."},
	"still new: nothing about it says anybody has been here long": {"en": "still new: nothing about it says anybody has been here long", "hu": "még új: semmi sem utal rá, hogy bárki régóta itt lenne"},
	"settled: the aisle is walked clean and the matting is down": {"en": "settled: the aisle is walked clean and the matting is down", "hu": "megülepedett: a folyosó tisztára van járva, és a szőnyeg lent van"},
	"starting to look kept: there is a walked aisle down the middle": {"en": "starting to look kept: there is a walked aisle down the middle", "hu": "kezd rendezettnek látszani: középen van egy kijárt folyosó"},
	"The room reads as %s.": {"en": "The room reads as %s.", "hu": "A terem ilyennek látszik: %s."},
	"that ticket is not open": {"en": "that ticket is not open", "hu": "az a jegy nincs nyitva"},
	"that is not somewhere to look": {"en": "that is not somewhere to look", "hu": "ott nincs mit nézni"},
	"Their service is genuinely not reachable from here.": {"en": "Their service is genuinely not reachable from here.", "hu": "A szolgáltatásuk innen tényleg nem elérhető."},
	"The path is up and over capacity: it is a bandwidth problem, not a fault.": {"en": "The path is up and over capacity: it is a bandwidth problem, not a fault.", "hu": "Az útvonal él és túlterhelt: ez sávszélesség-probléma, nem hiba."},
	"Your own tooling says the fault is past your edge.": {"en": "Your own tooling says the fault is past your edge.", "hu": "A saját eszközeid szerint a hiba a te széleden túl van."},
	"Everything of yours is healthy. This one is theirs.": {"en": "Everything of yours is healthy. This one is theirs.", "hu": "Nálad minden egészséges. Ez az övék."},
	"There is a console cable on it.": {"en": "There is a console cable on it.", "hu": "Van rajta konzolkábel."},
	"Console server, a walk to the rack, or a site visit.": {"en": "Console server, a walk to the rack, or a site visit.", "hu": "Konzolszerver, egy séta a rackhez, vagy telephelyi látogatás."},
	"you already know what that is": {"en": "you already know what that is", "hu": "már tudod, mi az"},
	"an afternoon of somebody's time costs $50": {"en": "an afternoon of somebody's time costs $50", "hu": "valakinek egy délutánja 50 $-ba kerül"},
	"It is load bearing: %s.": {"en": "It is load bearing: %s.", "hu": "Tartóelem: %s."},
	"Nothing has touched it and nothing depends on it. It can go.": {"en": "Nothing has touched it and nothing depends on it. It can go.", "hu": "Semmi sem nyúlt hozzá, és semmi sem függ tőle. Mehet."},
	"Reception rang. They have booked eleven people since you left.": {"en": "Reception rang. They have booked eleven people since you left.", "hu": "A recepció hívott. Tizenegy embert jegyeztek elő, mióta elmentél."},
	"The registers went in on time this morning. Nobody mentioned the network, which is the compliment.": {"en": "The registers went in on time this morning. Nobody mentioned the network, which is the compliment.", "hu": "A naplók ma reggel időben bekerültek. Senki sem említette a hálózatot, és ez a dicséret."},
	"We are live and the chat has stopped complaining. Thank you.": {"en": "We are live and the chat has stopped complaining. Thank you.", "hu": "Élőben vagyunk, és a chat abbahagyta a panaszkodást. Köszönjük."},
	"The line is moving. The supervisor says to tell you it is moving.": {"en": "The line is moving. The supervisor says to tell you it is moving.", "hu": "A sor megy. A műszakvezető azt üzeni, hogy megy."},
	"The first order came through while I was watching. The label printer made that noise.": {"en": "The first order came through while I was watching. The label printer made that noise.", "hu": "Az első rendelés akkor jött be, amikor néztem. A címkenyomtató kiadta azt a hangot."},
	"A small Budapest children's shop. Its web checkout sends each paid order straight to the label printer beside the packing table.": {"en": "A small Budapest children's shop. Its web checkout sends each paid order straight to the label printer beside the packing table.", "hu": "Egy kis budapesti gyerekbolt. A webes pénztára minden kifizetett rendelést egyből a csomagolóasztal melletti címkenyomtatóra küld."},
	"NO LIVE ORDERS YET": {"en": "NO LIVE ORDERS YET", "hu": "MÉG NINCS ÉLŐ RENDELÉS"},
	"Their team is preparing products and waiting for the promised service.": {"en": "Their team is preparing products and waiting for the promised service.", "hu": "A csapatuk termékeket készít elő, és várja a megígért szolgáltatást."},
	"“Tell us when it is ready; we would rather launch once than apologise twice.”": {"en": "“Tell us when it is ready; we would rather launch once than apologise twice.”", "hu": "„Szóljatok, ha kész; inkább egyszer indulunk, mint hogy kétszer kérjünk bocsánatot.”"},
	"ARRIVAL  /  FIRST PROMISE": {"en": "ARRIVAL  /  FIRST PROMISE", "hu": "ÉRKEZÉS  /  ELSŐ ÍGÉRET"},
	"They remember that you revised the proposal instead of walking away.": {"en": "They remember that you revised the proposal instead of walking away.", "hu": "Emlékeznek rá, hogy átdolgoztad az ajánlatot ahelyett, hogy elsétáltál volna."},
	"They chose you for the first launch and are watching how you operate.": {"en": "They chose you for the first launch and are watching how you operate.", "hu": "Téged választottak az első induláshoz, és figyelik, hogyan dolgozol."},
	"COMPLICATION  /  FIRST OUTAGE": {"en": "COMPLICATION  /  FIRST OUTAGE", "hu": "BONYODALOM  /  ELSŐ KIESÉS"},
	"You told them what was happening before touching the network.": {"en": "You told them what was happening before touching the network.", "hu": "Elmondtad nekik, mi történik, mielőtt a hálózathoz nyúltál."},
	"They are still waiting to hear what is happening.": {"en": "They are still waiting to hear what is happening.", "hu": "Még mindig várják, hogy megtudják, mi történik."},
	"RECOVERY  /  PROVING THE FIX": {"en": "RECOVERY  /  PROVING THE FIX", "hu": "HELYREÁLLÁS  /  A JAVÍTÁS BIZONYÍTÁSA"},
	"They remember the %s you left behind. Trust now depends on several quiet, healthy cycles.": {"en": "They remember the %s you left behind. Trust now depends on several quiet, healthy cycles.", "hu": "Emlékeznek arra, amit hátrahagytál: %s. A bizalom most több nyugodt, egészséges cikluson múlik."},
	"PAYOFF  /  TRUSTED OPERATOR": {"en": "PAYOFF  /  TRUSTED OPERATOR", "hu": "JUTALOM  /  MEGBÍZHATÓ ÜZEMELTETŐ"},
	"You communicated, repaired without a rescue, and proved the fix. Kiskacsa has sent Madaras Játék to your door.": {"en": "You communicated, repaired without a rescue, and proved the fix. Kiskacsa has sent Madaras Játék to your door.", "hu": "Kommunikáltál, mentőakció nélkül javítottál, és bizonyítottad a javítást. A Kiskacsa a Madaras Játékot küldte hozzád."},
	"PAYOFF  /  CAUTIOUS CUSTOMER": {"en": "PAYOFF  /  CAUTIOUS CUSTOMER", "hu": "JUTALOM  /  ÓVATOS ÜGYFÉL"},
	"Service is steady again, but the assisted restore made them renew cautiously and keep referrals close.": {"en": "Service is steady again, but the assisted restore made them renew cautiously and keep referrals close.", "hu": "A szolgáltatás újra stabil, de a segített helyreállítás miatt óvatosan újítottak, és nem ajánlanak tovább."},
	"CHECKOUT OFFLINE": {"en": "CHECKOUT OFFLINE", "hu": "PÉNZTÁR OFFLINE"},
	"Shoppers can browse cached pages, but checkout cannot submit an order. The packing table is quiet and new labels are not arriving.": {"en": "Shoppers can browse cached pages, but checkout cannot submit an order. The packing table is quiet and new labels are not arriving.", "hu": "A vásárlók böngészhetik a gyorsítótárazott oldalakat, de a pénztár nem tud rendelést leadni. A csomagolóasztal csendes, és nem jönnek új címkék."},
	"“We have paused the promotion. Please keep us updated; people are asking whether their order went through.”": {"en": "“We have paused the promotion. Please keep us updated; people are asking whether their order went through.”", "hu": "„Leállítottuk az akciót. Kérjük, tartsatok minket képben; az emberek kérdezik, átment-e a rendelésük.”"},
	"~%d SHOPPERS / CHECKOUT RETRYING": {"en": "~%d SHOPPERS / CHECKOUT RETRYING", "hu": "~%d VÁSÁRLÓ / A PÉNZTÁR ÚJRAPRÓBÁL"},
	"Pages are slow and some shoppers retry payment. Orders reach the packing table in bursts instead of a steady queue.": {"en": "Pages are slow and some shoppers retry payment. Orders reach the packing table in bursts instead of a steady queue.", "hu": "Az oldalak lassúak, és néhány vásárló újrapróbálja a fizetést. A rendelések löketekben érnek a csomagolóasztalhoz, nem egyenletes sorban."},
	"“It is working, but customers are pressing the button twice. Can you steady it?”": {"en": "“It is working, but customers are pressing the button twice. Can you steady it?”", "hu": "„Működik, de a vásárlók kétszer nyomják meg a gombot. Tudjátok stabilizálni?”"},
	"~%d SHOPPERS  ·  ~%d ORDERS/H": {"en": "~%d SHOPPERS  ·  ~%d ORDERS/H", "hu": "~%d VÁSÁRLÓ  ·  ~%d RENDELÉS/ÓRA"},
	"Checkout is accepting orders. Each success becomes a fresh shipping label at the packing table.": {"en": "Checkout is accepting orders. Each success becomes a fresh shipping label at the packing table.", "hu": "A pénztár fogadja a rendeléseket. Minden sikeres rendelésből új szállítási címke lesz a csomagolóasztalon."},
	"“The labels are moving again. Thank you for telling us what was happening while you fixed it.”": {"en": "“The labels are moving again. Thank you for telling us what was happening while you fixed it.”", "hu": "„A címkék újra mennek. Köszönjük, hogy elmondtátok, mi történik, amíg javítottátok.”"},
	"“The next label just printed. That little sound means the shop is working.”": {"en": "“The next label just printed. That little sound means the shop is working.”", "hu": "„Most nyomtatódott a következő címke. Az a kis hang azt jelenti, hogy a bolt működik.”"},
	"cold spare": {"en": "cold spare", "hu": "hideg tartalék"},
	"permanent monitor": {"en": "permanent monitor", "hu": "állandó monitor"},
	"saved recovery configuration": {"en": "saved recovery configuration", "hu": "mentett helyreállítási konfiguráció"},
	"resilience improvement": {"en": "resilience improvement", "hu": "ellenállóképesség-javítás"},
	"NOT LIVE YET": {"en": "NOT LIVE YET", "hu": "MÉG NEM ÉL"},
	"They are waiting for the service they were promised.": {"en": "They are waiting for the service they were promised.", "hu": "Várják a szolgáltatást, amit megígértek nekik."},
	"“Tell us when it is ready.”": {"en": "“Tell us when it is ready.”", "hu": "„Szóljatok, ha kész.”"},
	"%s They have %d outage(s) of yours on record.": {"en": "%s They have %d outage(s) of yours on record.", "hu": "%s %d kiesésed van náluk feljegyezve."},
	"They are watching how this one goes.": {"en": "They are watching how this one goes.", "hu": "Figyelik, hogy ez hogyan alakul."},
	"They have told you in advance: %s carries about %d times their normal traffic. They will remember how it went.": {"en": "They have told you in advance: %s carries about %d times their normal traffic. They will remember how it went.", "hu": "Előre szóltak: %s nagyjából %d-szerese a szokásos forgalmuknak. Emlékezni fognak rá, hogyan ment."},
	"You held their busiest hours together, and they have said so out loud.": {"en": "You held their busiest hours together, and they have said so out loud.", "hu": "Kitartottál a legforgalmasabb óráikban, és ezt hangosan ki is mondták."},
	"%s STOPPED": {"en": "%s STOPPED", "hu": "%s LEÁLLT"},
	"“Please keep us updated; people are asking.”": {"en": "“Please keep us updated; people are asking.”", "hu": "„Kérjük, tartsatok minket képben; az emberek kérdeznek.”"},
	"~%d %s / RETRYING": {"en": "~%d %s / RETRYING", "hu": "~%d %s / ÚJRAPRÓBÁL"},
	"“It works, but only just. Can you steady it?”": {"en": "“It works, but only just. Can you steady it?”", "hu": "„Működik, de éppen csak. Tudjátok stabilizálni?”"},
	"~%d %s  ·  ~%d %s/H": {"en": "~%d %s  ·  ~%d %s/H", "hu": "~%d %s  ·  ~%d %s/ÓRA"},
	"“Nobody here is thinking about the network, which is how we like it.”": {"en": "“Nobody here is thinking about the network, which is how we like it.”", "hu": "„Itt senki sem gondol a hálózatra, és pont így szeretjük.”"},
	"%s is physically installed with %d occupied device slots.": {"en": "%s is physically installed with %d occupied device slots.", "hu": "%s fizikailag be van szerelve, %d foglalt eszközhellyel."},
	"Two seated access patches: %s.": {"en": "Two seated access patches: %s.", "hu": "Két beültetett access patch: %s."},
	"Physical layer first": {"en": "Physical layer first", "hu": "Először a fizikai réteg"},
	"Trace and label both ends before configuring a protocol.": {"en": "Trace and label both ends before configuring a protocol.", "hu": "Kövesd végig és címkézd fel mindkét véget, mielőtt protokollt konfigurálsz."},
	"No logical fix can rescue a server that is not physically patched.": {"en": "No logical fix can rescue a server that is not physically patched.", "hu": "Semmilyen logikai javítás nem menti meg a szervert, amely fizikailag nincs bepatchelve."},
	"Label both ends of a cable run (a note on the port), or fit blanking panels in every unused rack unit.": {"en": "Label both ends of a cable run (a note on the port), or fit blanking panels in every unused rack unit.", "hu": "Címkézd fel a kábelút mindkét végét (egy megjegyzés a porton), vagy tegyél vakpanelt minden használatlan rackegységbe."},
	"%s %s (10.0.0.1)  →  switched network  →  %s %s (10.0.0.2)": {"en": "%s %s (10.0.0.1)  →  switched network  →  %s %s (10.0.0.2)", "hu": "%s %s (10.0.0.1)  →  kapcsolt hálózat  →  %s %s (10.0.0.2)"},
	"10.0.0.1 reached 10.0.0.2 on the live /24 without a gateway hop.": {"en": "10.0.0.1 reached 10.0.0.2 on the live /24 without a gateway hop.", "hu": "A 10.0.0.1 elérte a 10.0.0.2-t az élő /24-en, gateway ugrás nélkül."},
	"Same-subnet switching": {"en": "Same-subnet switching", "hu": "Azonos alhálózaton belüli kapcsolás"},
	"A router was not added where one broadcast domain was enough.": {"en": "A router was not added where one broadcast domain was enough.", "hu": "Nem került router oda, ahol egy broadcast domain is elég volt."},
	"Keep both server route tables empty; this path needs no gateway.": {"en": "Keep both server route tables empty; this path needs no gateway.", "hu": "Tartsd üresen mindkét szerver útvonaltábláját; ennek az útnak nem kell gateway."},
	"%s keeps VLAN 10 on %s.": {"en": "%s keeps VLAN 10 on %s.", "hu": "%s a VLAN 10-et ezeken tartja: %s."},
	"%s keeps VLAN 20 on %s; the former ping is now correctly blocked.": {"en": "%s keeps VLAN 20 on %s; the former ping is now correctly blocked.", "hu": "%s a VLAN 20-at ezeken tartja: %s; a korábbi ping most helyesen blokkolva van."},
	"Separate broadcast domains": {"en": "Separate broadcast domains", "hu": "Külön broadcast domainek"},
	"Sharing an IPv4 prefix did not punch through the VLAN boundary.": {"en": "Sharing an IPv4 prefix did not punch through the VLAN boundary.", "hu": "A közös IPv4 prefix nem ütötte át a VLAN-határt."},
	"Add 10.0.0.3 to VLAN 10 while keeping VLAN 20 isolated.": {"en": "Add 10.0.0.3 to VLAN 10 while keeping VLAN 20 isolated.", "hu": "Add a 10.0.0.3-at a VLAN 10-hez úgy, hogy a VLAN 20 elkülönítve marad."},
	"Tagged path: %s %s  ⇄  %s %s; both ends are trunks.": {"en": "Tagged path: %s %s  ⇄  %s %s; both ends are trunks.", "hu": "Címkézett út: %s %s  ⇄  %s %s; mindkét vég trunk."},
	"10.0.0.3 reaches 10.0.0.1 across that link while 10.0.0.2 remains isolated.": {"en": "10.0.0.3 reaches 10.0.0.1 across that link while 10.0.0.2 remains isolated.", "hu": "A 10.0.0.3 eléri a 10.0.0.1-et azon a linken át, míg a 10.0.0.2 elkülönítve marad."},
	"802.1Q trunks carry several VLANs": {"en": "802.1Q trunks carry several VLANs", "hu": "A 802.1Q trunkök több VLAN-t visznek"},
	"Both trunk ends agree; a one-sided trunk would silently drop tagged traffic.": {"en": "Both trunk ends agree; a one-sided trunk would silently drop tagged traffic.", "hu": "A trunk két vége egyetért; egy egyoldalú trunk csendben eldobná a címkézett forgalmat."},
	"Prune every inter-switch trunk to VLANs 10 and 20 only.": {"en": "Prune every inter-switch trunk to VLANs 10 and 20 only.", "hu": "Szűkíts minden switchek közötti trunköt csak a VLAN 10-re és 20-ra."},
	"Parallel paths: %s.": {"en": "Parallel paths: %s.", "hu": "Párhuzamos utak: %s."},
	"Spanning tree placed %s in discarding state; Alfa still has one forwarding path.": {"en": "Spanning tree placed %s in discarding state; Alfa still has one forwarding path.", "hu": "A spanning tree a(z) %s portot discarding állapotba tette; az Alfának még van egy továbbító útja."},
	"A loop-free spare path": {"en": "A loop-free spare path", "hu": "Hurokmentes tartalék út"},
	"The second cable did not create a broadcast storm.": {"en": "The second cable did not create a broadcast storm.", "hu": "A második kábel nem okozott broadcast vihart."},
	"Disable the forwarding member and prove Alfa still crosses the spare.": {"en": "Disable the forwarding member and prove Alfa still crosses the spare.", "hu": "Tiltsd le a továbbító tagot, és bizonyítsd, hogy az Alfa még átmegy a tartalékon."},
	"%s %s (192.168.1.10)  →  gateway %s %s (192.168.1.1).": {"en": "%s %s (192.168.1.10)  →  gateway %s %s (192.168.1.1).", "hu": "%s %s (192.168.1.10)  →  gateway %s %s (192.168.1.1)."},
	"%s routes into %s (192.168.2.1)  →  %s %s (192.168.2.10); replies return through the same router.": {"en": "%s routes into %s (192.168.2.1)  →  %s %s (192.168.2.10); replies return through the same router.", "hu": "%s ide routol: %s (192.168.2.1)  →  %s %s (192.168.2.10); a válaszok ugyanazon a routeren jönnek vissza."},
	"A router joins different IP subnets": {"en": "A router joins different IP subnets", "hu": "A router különböző IP alhálózatokat köt össze"},
	"The hosts do not pretend remote addresses are on their local wire.": {"en": "The hosts do not pretend remote addresses are on their local wire.", "hu": "A hostok nem tesznek úgy, mintha a távoli címek a saját vezetékükön lennének."},
	"Save the working configuration on %s.": {"en": "Save the working configuration on %s.", "hu": "Mentsd el a működő konfigurációt ezen: %s."},
	"%s holds an established eBGP session with %s.": {"en": "%s holds an established eBGP session with %s.", "hu": "%s felépített eBGP sessiont tart fenn ezzel: %s."},
	"Its table carries %d announced prefix(es), and a default arrives from upstream.": {"en": "Its table carries %d announced prefix(es), and a default arrives from upstream.", "hu": "A táblája %d hirdetett prefixet visz, és az upstreamtől érkezik egy default."},
	"Somebody else's network, on purpose": {"en": "Somebody else's network, on purpose", "hu": "Valaki más hálózata, szándékosan"},
	"The default route is learned, not invented, so it disappears when the session does.": {"en": "The default route is learned, not invented, so it disappears when the session does.", "hu": "A default útvonal tanult, nem kitalált, így eltűnik, amikor a session is."},
	"Keep the session up while announcing your own prefix.": {"en": "Keep the session up while announcing your own prefix.", "hu": "Tartsd fenn a sessiont, miközben a saját prefixedet hirdeted."},
	"%s %s is the outside interface; private sources leave as %s.": {"en": "%s %s is the outside interface; private sources leave as %s.", "hu": "%s %s a külső interfész; a privát források így távoznak: %s."},
	"its own address": {"en": "its own address", "hu": "a saját címe"},
	"Return traffic is matched back to the machine that sent it, which is why one address serves many.": {"en": "Return traffic is matched back to the machine that sent it, which is why one address serves many.", "hu": "A visszatérő forgalom ahhoz a géphez kerül vissza, amelyik küldte, ezért szolgál ki egy cím sokakat."},
	"Source NAT, and the state it keeps": {"en": "Source NAT, and the state it keeps", "hu": "Forrás NAT, és az állapot, amit tart"},
	"Nothing inside had to be renumbered to reach the internet.": {"en": "Nothing inside had to be renumbered to reach the internet.", "hu": "Belül semmit sem kellett átszámozni az internet eléréséhez."},
	"Reach the internet from two machines behind the same address.": {"en": "Reach the internet from two machines behind the same address.", "hu": "Érd el az internetet két gépről ugyanazon cím mögül."},
	"%s are running OSPF and have formed an adjacency.": {"en": "%s are running OSPF and have formed an adjacency.", "hu": "%s OSPF-et futtatnak, és szomszédságot alakítottak ki."},
	"Routes appear and disappear on their own, which is the entire difference from static.": {"en": "Routes appear and disappear on their own, which is the entire difference from static.", "hu": "Az útvonalak maguktól jelennek meg és tűnnek el, és pont ez a különbség a statikushoz képest."},
	"Routers telling each other what they know": {"en": "Routers telling each other what they know", "hu": "Routerek, amelyek elmondják egymásnak, amit tudnak"},
	"Nobody has to remember to add a static route when the topology changes.": {"en": "Nobody has to remember to add a static route when the topology changes.", "hu": "Senkinek sem kell észben tartania, hogy statikus útvonalat adjon hozzá, amikor a topológia változik."},
	"Break one path and watch the table reconverge without you.": {"en": "Break one path and watch the table reconverge without you.", "hu": "Szakíts meg egy utat, és nézd, ahogy a tábla nélküled újrakonvergál."},
	"%s %s (priority %d)": {"en": "%s %s (priority %d)", "hu": "%s %s (prioritás %d)"},
	"Virtual address %s is served by %s.": {"en": "Virtual address %s is served by %s.", "hu": "A(z) %s virtuális címet ez szolgálja ki: %s."},
	"The hosts point at one gateway address that outlives either router.": {"en": "The hosts point at one gateway address that outlives either router.", "hu": "A hostok egyetlen gateway címre mutatnak, amely bármelyik routert túléli."},
	"A gateway that is not a single box": {"en": "A gateway that is not a single box", "hu": "Egy gateway, amely nem egyetlen doboz"},
	"Nothing had to be reconfigured on the hosts when the master changed.": {"en": "Nothing had to be reconfigured on the hosts when the master changed.", "hu": "Semmit sem kellett átkonfigurálni a hostokon, amikor a master változott."},
	"Take the master away and keep the hosts online.": {"en": "Take the master away and keep the hosts online.", "hu": "Vedd el a mastert, és tartsd online a hostokat."},
	"One logical link over %d members: %s.": {"en": "One logical link over %d members: %s.", "hu": "Egy logikai link %d tagon: %s."},
	"Capacity is the sum of the live members, and losing one is a slowdown rather than an outage.": {"en": "Capacity is the sum of the live members, and losing one is a slowdown rather than an outage.", "hu": "A kapacitás az élő tagok összege, és egy elvesztése lassulás, nem kiesés."},
	"Bundling links instead of blocking them": {"en": "Bundling links instead of blocking them", "hu": "Linkek kötegelése blokkolás helyett"},
	"Spanning tree did not throw the second cable away.": {"en": "Spanning tree did not throw the second cable away.", "hu": "A spanning tree nem dobta el a második kábelt."},
	"Pull one member and keep the traffic flowing.": {"en": "Pull one member and keep the traffic flowing.", "hu": "Húzz ki egy tagot, és tartsd folyamatban a forgalmat."},
	"A %d Mbps circuit from %s joins %s and %s.": {"en": "A %d Mbps circuit from %s joins %s and %s.", "hu": "Egy %d Mbps-os áramkör (%s) köti össze ezeket: %s és %s."},
	"a carrier": {"en": "a carrier", "hu": "egy szolgáltató"},
	"The two floors are one network, and the circuit is billed whether you use it or not.": {"en": "The two floors are one network, and the circuit is billed whether you use it or not.", "hu": "A két gépterem egy hálózat, és az áramkört akkor is számlázzák, ha nem használod."},
	"Somebody else's fibre, rented by the cycle": {"en": "Somebody else's fibre, rented by the cycle", "hu": "Valaki más üvegszála, ciklusonként bérelve"},
	"traceroute across the circuit and watch the latency": {"en": "traceroute across the circuit and watch the latency", "hu": "traceroute az áramkörön át, és figyeld a késleltetést"},
	"Neither site pretends the other is on its own wire.": {"en": "Neither site pretends the other is on its own wire.", "hu": "Egyik telephely sem tesz úgy, mintha a másik a saját vezetékén lenne."},
	"Keep both sites delivering while one carrier is down.": {"en": "Keep both sites delivering while one carrier is down.", "hu": "Tartsd mindkét telephelyet működésben, amíg az egyik szolgáltató kiesett."},
	"%s %s holds 2001:db8:70::10 alongside its IPv4 address.": {"en": "%s %s holds 2001:db8:70::10 alongside its IPv4 address.", "hu": "%s %s a 2001:db8:70::10 címet tartja az IPv4 címe mellett."},
	"Neighbour Discovery does the work ARP used to, on the same wire, at the same time.": {"en": "Neighbour Discovery does the work ARP used to, on the same wire, at the same time.", "hu": "A Neighbour Discovery végzi azt, amit régen az ARP, ugyanazon a vezetéken, egyszerre."},
	"Two protocols, one network": {"en": "Two protocols, one network", "hu": "Két protokoll, egy hálózat"},
	"Nothing had to be turned off to add the second family.": {"en": "Nothing had to be turned off to add the second family.", "hu": "Semmit sem kellett kikapcsolni a második címcsalád hozzáadásához."},
	"Reach the far host over IPv6 with the IPv4 path shut.": {"en": "Reach the far host over IPv6 with the IPv4 path shut.", "hu": "Érd el a távoli hostot IPv6-on, lezárt IPv4 úttal."},
	"%s translates %s into IPv4 from the pool %s.": {"en": "%s translates %s into IPv4 from the pool %s.", "hu": "%s a(z) %s prefixet IPv4-re fordítja a(z) %s poolból."},
	"The tenant never received an IPv4 address, and the legacy service never learned IPv6.": {"en": "The tenant never received an IPv4 address, and the legacy service never learned IPv6.", "hu": "A bérlő sosem kapott IPv4 címet, és a régi szolgáltatás sosem tanult meg IPv6-ot."},
	"Naming and translation are two separate halves": {"en": "Naming and translation are two separate halves", "hu": "A névfeloldás és a fordítás két külön fél"},
	"No dual-stack was forced on either end to make them talk.": {"en": "No dual-stack was forced on either end to make them talk.", "hu": "Egyik végre sem kellett dual-stacket erőltetni, hogy beszéljenek egymással."},
	"Keep native IPv6 traffic out of the translator entirely.": {"en": "Keep native IPv6 traffic out of the translator entirely.", "hu": "Tartsd a natív IPv6 forgalmat teljesen távol a fordítótól."},
	"%s and %s carry VNI %d over a routed underlay.": {"en": "%s and %s carry VNI %d over a routed underlay.", "hu": "%s és %s a(z) %d VNI-t viszi routolt underlay fölött."},
	"The tenant's segment crosses a network that has no idea it is carrying layer 2.": {"en": "The tenant's segment crosses a network that has no idea it is carrying layer 2.", "hu": "A bérlő szegmense olyan hálózaton kel át, amelynek fogalma sincs, hogy 2. réteget visz."},
	"A segment that does not need a cable between the switches": {"en": "A segment that does not need a cable between the switches", "hu": "Egy szegmens, amelyhez nem kell kábel a switchek között"},
	"Nobody had to stretch a VLAN across the fabric to do it.": {"en": "Nobody had to stretch a VLAN across the fabric to do it.", "hu": "Senkinek sem kellett VLAN-t átnyújtania a fabricon ehhez."},
	"Let the control plane advertise instead of flooding.": {"en": "Let the control plane advertise instead of flooding.", "hu": "Hagyd, hogy a vezérlősík hirdessen elárasztás helyett."},
	"%s enforces %d rule(s) in front of the customer segment.": {"en": "%s enforces %d rule(s) in front of the customer segment.", "hu": "%s %d szabályt érvényesít az ügyfélszegmens előtt."},
	"Everything they audited (their VLAN, their address, the rule, the routing, the managed switch) is live at once.": {"en": "Everything they audited (their VLAN, their address, the rule, the routing, the managed switch) is live at once.", "hu": "Minden, amit auditáltak (a VLAN-juk, a címük, a szabály, a routing, a menedzselt switch), egyszerre él."},
	"An estate, rather than a collection of devices": {"en": "An estate, rather than a collection of devices", "hu": "Egy eszközpark, nem eszközök halmaza"},
	"No single requirement was met by breaking another one.": {"en": "No single requirement was met by breaking another one.", "hu": "Egyetlen követelmény sem teljesült egy másik megszegésével."},
	"Keep every one of their requirements true for a full quarter.": {"en": "Keep every one of their requirements true for a full quarter.", "hu": "Tartsd minden követelményüket igaznak egy teljes negyedéven át."},
	"They were not being looked after and are prepared to like you.": {"en": "They were not being looked after and are prepared to like you.", "hu": "Nem törődtek velük, és hajlandók megkedvelni téged."},
	"They are watching to see whether this was good news.": {"en": "They are watching to see whether this was good news.", "hu": "Figyelik, hogy ez jó hír volt-e."},
	"They did not ask to be sold, and it shows.": {"en": "They did not ask to be sold, and it shows.", "hu": "Nem kérték, hogy eladják őket, és ez látszik."},
	"Their network is cabled to yours": {"en": "Their network is cabled to yours", "hu": "A hálózatuk össze van kábelezve a tiéddel"},
	"No duplicate addresses across the merged estate": {"en": "No duplicate addresses across the merged estate", "hu": "Nincs duplikált cím az összevont eszközparkban"},
	"Inherited customers reachable from your side": {"en": "Inherited customers reachable from your side", "hu": "Az örökölt ügyfelek elérhetők a te oldaladról"},
	"Their gear has its configuration saved": {"en": "Their gear has its configuration saved", "hu": "Az eszközeik konfigurációja el van mentve"},
	"The original port is no longer installed. Inspect the current service path.": {"en": "The original port is no longer installed. Inspect the current service path.", "hu": "Az eredeti port már nincs beszerelve. Vizsgáld meg a jelenlegi szolgáltatási utat."},
	"%s has an open gap at U%d. A blanking panel would stop it breathing its own exhaust.": {"en": "%s has an open gap at U%d. A blanking panel would stop it breathing its own exhaust.", "hu": "%s nyitott rést hagy a(z) U%d helyen. Egy vakpanel megakadályozná, hogy a saját kifújt levegőjét szívja."},
	"%s is running a configuration nobody has saved.": {"en": "%s is running a configuration nobody has saved.", "hu": "%s olyan konfigurációval fut, amit senki sem mentett el."},
	"%s %s is patched and unlabelled. Future you will not remember what it is.": {"en": "%s %s is patched and unlabelled. Future you will not remember what it is.", "hu": "%s %s be van patchelve és nincs címkézve. A jövőbeli éned nem fog emlékezni, mi az."},
	"The floor is in order. Walk it, watch the traffic move, and enjoy it.": {"en": "The floor is in order. Walk it, watch the traffic move, and enjoy it.", "hu": "A gépterem rendben van. Járd be, nézd, ahogy megy a forgalom, és élvezd."},
	"%d cycles on the floor": {"en": "%d cycles on the floor", "hu": "%d ciklus a gépteremben"},
	"%d job(s) signed off": {"en": "%d job(s) signed off", "hu": "%d munka leigazolva"},
	"a best run of %d cycles with nobody down": {"en": "a best run of %d cycles with nobody down", "hu": "a legjobb sorozat %d ciklus úgy, hogy senki sem esett ki"},
	"and along the way you did %s": {"en": "and along the way you did %s", "hu": "és közben ezt csináltad: %s"},
	"This shift: ": {"en": "This shift: ", "hu": "Ez a műszak: "},
	"you do %s without thinking about it now": {"en": "you do %s without thinking about it now", "hu": "ezt már gondolkodás nélkül csinálod: %s"},
	"%d job(s) finished the harder way": {"en": "%d job(s) finished the harder way", "hu": "%d munka a nehezebb úton befejezve"},
	"%d customer(s) who will say so out loud": {"en": "%d customer(s) who will say so out loud", "hu": "%d ügyfél, aki ezt hangosan ki is mondja"},
	"a %d cycle stretch with nobody down": {"en": "a %d cycle stretch with nobody down", "hu": "%d ciklusnyi szakasz úgy, hogy senki sem esett ki"},
	"and %s, which the trade also notices": {"en": "and %s, which the trade also notices", "hu": "és %s, amit a szakma is észrevesz"},
	"mostly on the money, which is one way to do it": {"en": "mostly on the money, which is one way to do it", "hu": "leginkább a pénz miatt, ami az egyik módja"},
	"the odd bad night": {"en": "the odd bad night", "hu": "az egy-egy rossz éjszaka"},
	"NOC operator": {"en": "NOC operator", "hu": "NOC operátor"},
	"Watches the network and restores tripped links.": {"en": "Watches the network and restores tripped links.", "hu": "Figyeli a hálózatot, és visszaállítja a kiesett linkeket."},
	"Fixes faults faster and keeps configurations saved.": {"en": "Fixes faults faster and keeps configurations saved.", "hu": "Gyorsabban javítja a hibákat, és elmentve tartja a konfigurációkat."},
	"Field technician": {"en": "Field technician", "hu": "Helyszíni technikus"},
	"Repairs cabling and swaps failed hardware quickly.": {"en": "Repairs cabling and swaps failed hardware quickly.", "hu": "Javítja a kábelezést, és gyorsan cseréli a meghibásodott hardvert."},
	"Switching and VLANs": {"en": "Switching and VLANs", "hu": "Switching és VLAN-ok"},
	"Routing and BGP": {"en": "Routing and BGP", "hu": "Routing és BGP"},
	"Hardware and cabling": {"en": "Hardware and cabling", "hu": "Hardver és kábelezés"},
	"the course costs $%d%s": {"en": "the course costs $%d%s", "hu": "a tanfolyam %d $-ba kerül%s"},
	" for a %s": {"en": " for a %s", "hu": " egy %s számára"},
	"I labelled it while I was in there.": {"en": "I labelled it while I was in there.", "hu": "Felcímkéztem, amíg ott voltam."},
	"Traced it end to end before I touched anything.": {"en": "Traced it end to end before I touched anything.", "hu": "Végigkövettem az egyik végétől a másikig, mielőtt bármihez nyúltam."},
	"Back up. I did not stop to write it down.": {"en": "Back up. I did not stop to write it down.", "hu": "Megint megy. Nem álltam meg leírni."},
	"Up again. Do not ask me which port it was.": {"en": "Up again. Do not ask me which port it was.", "hu": "Újra megy. Ne kérdezd, melyik port volt."},
	"It is up. I am going home.": {"en": "It is up. I am going home.", "hu": "Megy. Megyek haza."},
	"Fixed. That is the third one tonight.": {"en": "Fixed. That is the third one tonight.", "hu": "Javítva. Ez a harmadik ma éjjel."},
	"That was me. I was on the wrong port.": {"en": "That was me. I was on the wrong port.", "hu": "Az én voltam. Rossz porton voltam."},
	"My fault, and I have written down what I did.": {"en": "My fault, and I have written down what I did.", "hu": "Az én hibám, és leírtam, mit csináltam."},
	"Something went down while I was in there.": {"en": "Something went down while I was in there.", "hu": "Valami leállt, amíg bent voltam."},
	"That might have been me.": {"en": "That might have been me.", "hu": "Lehet, hogy az én voltam."},
	"I have been here since six. That one is on me.": {"en": "I have been here since six. That one is on me.", "hu": "Hat óta itt vagyok. Ez az én saram."},
	"I read the wrong label. I am sorry.": {"en": "I read the wrong label. I am sorry.", "hu": "Rossz címkét olvastam. Sajnálom."},
	"Understood. It will not happen twice.": {"en": "Understood. It will not happen twice.", "hu": "Értettem. Nem fordul elő még egyszer."},
	"I would rather have been told first.": {"en": "I would rather have been told first.", "hu": "Jobb lett volna, ha előbb nekem szólnak."},
	"Right. Noted.": {"en": "Right. Noted.", "hu": "Rendben. Tudomásul vettem."},
	"Fine.": {"en": "Fine.", "hu": "Jó."},
	"I see.": {"en": "I see.", "hu": "Értem."},
	"Understood.": {"en": "Understood.", "hu": "Értettem."},
	"You did not have to do that. Thank you.": {"en": "You did not have to do that. Thank you.", "hu": "Nem kellett volna. Köszönöm."},
	"I will not forget that.": {"en": "I will not forget that.", "hu": "Ezt nem felejtem el."},
	"Cheers. I owe you one.": {"en": "Cheers. I owe you one.", "hu": "Kösz. Jövök eggyel."},
	"Appreciated.": {"en": "Appreciated.", "hu": "Köszönöm."},
	"Thank you. Genuinely.": {"en": "Thank you. Genuinely.", "hu": "Köszönöm. Őszintén."},
	"That means something at this hour.": {"en": "That means something at this hour.", "hu": "Ez jelent valamit ilyenkor."},
	"I have enjoyed most of it. The pay stopped making sense.": {"en": "I have enjoyed most of it. The pay stopped making sense.", "hu": "A nagy részét élveztem. A fizetésnek már nem volt értelme."},
	"I am handing over properly. That matters to me.": {"en": "I am handing over properly. That matters to me.", "hu": "Rendesen átadom. Ez számít nekem."},
	"I am off. Somebody else can do the nights.": {"en": "I am off. Somebody else can do the nights.", "hu": "Én léptem. Az éjszakákat csinálja más."},
	"I have had enough of this.": {"en": "I have had enough of this.", "hu": "Ebből elegem van."},
	"I cannot keep doing the hours.": {"en": "I cannot keep doing the hours.", "hu": "Nem bírom tovább ezeket az órákat."},
	"I am too tired to argue about it.": {"en": "I am too tired to argue about it.", "hu": "Túl fáradt vagyok, hogy vitatkozzak róla."},
	"I will keep on top of it.": {"en": "I will keep on top of it.", "hu": "Rajta tartom a szemem."},
	"I will do it the way you have been doing it.": {"en": "I will do it the way you have been doing it.", "hu": "Úgy csinálom, ahogy te csináltad."},
	"I will get to it.": {"en": "I will get to it.", "hu": "Sorra kerítem."},
	"Sure, add it to the pile.": {"en": "Sure, add it to the pile.", "hu": "Persze, tedd a kupacra."},
	"If I have time.": {"en": "If I have time.", "hu": "Ha lesz időm."},
	"Right.": {"en": "Right.", "hu": "Rendben."},
	"That was worth doing. I have notes.": {"en": "That was worth doing. I have notes.", "hu": "Megérte. Vannak jegyzeteim."},
	"I know what I am looking at now.": {"en": "I know what I am looking at now.", "hu": "Most már tudom, mit látok."},
	"Passed. Mostly slept through the second day.": {"en": "Passed. Mostly slept through the second day.", "hu": "Átmentem. A második napot nagyrészt átaludtam."},
	"Done. Can I get back to work?": {"en": "Done. Can I get back to work?", "hu": "Kész. Visszamehetek dolgozni?"},
	"Passed. I needed the week off more than the course.": {"en": "Passed. I needed the week off more than the course.", "hu": "Átmentem. A szabad hétre jobban szükségem volt, mint a tanfolyamra."},
	"Finished it. Barely.": {"en": "Finished it. Barely.", "hu": "Befejeztem. Épphogy."},
	"cut-price": {"en": "cut-price", "hu": "árromboló"},
	"Undercuts everyone and delivers accordingly.": {"en": "Undercuts everyone and delivers accordingly.", "hu": "Mindenki alá ígér, és ennek megfelelően teljesít."},
	"premium": {"en": "premium", "hu": "prémium"},
	"Expensive, and their customers stay.": {"en": "Expensive, and their customers stay.", "hu": "Drága, és az ügyfeleik maradnak."},
	"volume": {"en": "volume", "hu": "tömeges"},
	"Takes everything, grows fast, stretched thin.": {"en": "Takes everything, grows fast, stretched thin.", "hu": "Mindent elvállal, gyorsan nő, vékonyra nyúlik."},
	"specialist": {"en": "specialist", "hu": "specialista"},
	"Only bids on work it is good at, and wins it.": {"en": "Only bids on work it is good at, and wins it.", "hu": "Csak arra a munkára ad árat, amiben jó, és meg is nyeri."},
	"acquisitive": {"en": "acquisitive", "hu": "felvásárló"},
	"Would rather buy a competitor than out-bid one.": {"en": "Would rather buy a competitor than out-bid one.", "hu": "Inkább megvesz egy versenytársat, mint hogy alálicitáljon."},
	"all mouth": {"en": "all mouth", "hu": "nagy szájú"},
	"Wins on charm and price, and cannot always deliver what he sold.": {"en": "Wins on charm and price, and cannot always deliver what he sold.", "hu": "Sármmal és árral nyer, és nem mindig tudja leszállítani, amit eladott."},
	"“No hard feelings. You will find out what that customer is like soon enough.”": {"en": "“No hard feelings. You will find out what that customer is like soon enough.”", "hu": "„Semmi harag. Hamar meg fogod tudni, milyen az az ügyfél.”"},
	"“Look, I have oversold myself again. Could you take one off my hands?”": {"en": "“Look, I have oversold myself again. Could you take one off my hands?”", "hu": "„Nézd, megint túlvállaltam magam. Át tudnál venni egyet?”"},
	"“You are going around telling people I do not deliver. Noted.”": {"en": "“You are going around telling people I do not deliver. Noted.”", "hu": "„Azt mesélgeted az embereknek, hogy nem szállítok. Feljegyeztem.”"},
	"pure tech": {"en": "pure tech", "hu": "tiszta technika"},
	"Beautiful network, terrible pricing, no patience for customers at all.": {"en": "Beautiful network, terrible pricing, no patience for customers at all.", "hu": "Gyönyörű hálózat, szörnyű árazás, és semmi türelem az ügyfelekhez."},
	"“Fine. They wanted hand-holding, and I do not do hand-holding.”": {"en": "“Fine. They wanted hand-holding, and I do not do hand-holding.”", "hu": "„Jó. Kézen fogva akarták vezetni őket, én meg nem vezetek kézen fogva senkit.”"},
	"“I have a spare optic and you clearly need one. Come and get it.”": {"en": "“I have a spare optic and you clearly need one. Come and get it.”", "hu": "„Van egy tartalék optikám, neked meg nyilván kell egy. Gyere érte.”"},
	"“Your design is wrong and I have stopped explaining why.”": {"en": "“Your design is wrong and I have stopped explaining why.”", "hu": "„A terved rossz, és már nem magyarázom el, miért.”"},
	"cheap and cheerful": {"en": "cheap and cheerful", "hu": "olcsó és vidám"},
	"Undercuts everyone and cuts the corners you can see from here.": {"en": "Undercuts everyone and cuts the corners you can see from here.", "hu": "Mindenki alá ígér, és olyan sarkokat vág le, amiket innen is látni."},
	"“Enjoy it. We will have them back next quarter at half your price.”": {"en": "“Enjoy it. We will have them back next quarter at half your price.”", "hu": "„Élvezd. Jövő negyedévben visszaszerezzük őket a te árad feléért.”"},
	"“Cover a shift for us and we will remember it. Probably.”": {"en": "“Cover a shift for us and we will remember it. Probably.”", "hu": "„Vállalj át nekünk egy műszakot, és emlékezni fogunk rá. Valószínűleg.”"},
	"“We will be quoting under you on everything now. Everything.”": {"en": "“We will be quoting under you on everything now. Everything.”", "hu": "„Mostantól mindenre alád ígérünk. Mindenre.”"},
	"twenty years in": {"en": "twenty years in", "hu": "húsz éve a szakmában"},
	"Has done all of this before and is simply better at it for a long while.": {"en": "Has done all of this before and is simply better at it for a long while.", "hu": "Mindezt csinálta már, és egyszerűen jobb benne, még jó ideig."},
	"“Good quote. You are learning. Do not get comfortable.”": {"en": "“Good quote. You are learning. Do not get comfortable.”", "hu": "„Jó ajánlat. Tanulsz. Ne kényelmesedj el.”"},
	"“Heard you had a bad night. Ring me before the next one.”": {"en": "“Heard you had a bad night. Ring me before the next one.”", "hu": "„Hallom, rossz éjszakád volt. Hívj fel a következő előtt.”"},
	"“I have been doing this since before your first switch. Watch.”": {"en": "“I have been doing this since before your first switch. Watch.”", "hu": "„Az első switched előtt is ezt csináltam már. Figyelj.”"},
	"service turn-up": {"en": "service turn-up", "hu": "szolgáltatás-üzembehelyezés"},
	"You took a written requirement and made it answer on the wire. In the trade that is a service turn-up, and it is the whole job in miniature.": {"en": "You took a written requirement and made it answer on the wire. In the trade that is a service turn-up, and it is the whole job in miniature.", "hu": "Fogtál egy leírt követelményt, és elérted, hogy válaszoljon a vezetéken. A szakmában ez a szolgáltatás-üzembehelyezés, és ez az egész munka kicsiben."},
